T[1517]={"^Critical strikes increase your parry and dodge chance by (.-)%%, stacking up to (.-) times%.\n\nFailure to reach at least 10 stacks will cause you to take damage equal to (.-)%% of your maximum health%.%s*$","爆击使你的招架和躲闪几率提高{{1}}%，最多可叠加{{2}}次。\n\n若未达到至少10层，你将受到相当于最大生命值{{3}}%的伤害。"}
