T[1530]={"^Magic Lock now also attempts to steal a beneficial magic effect from its target, lasting up to 2 min%.\n\nIf it succeeds, it also burns (.-) mana from them, causing damage equal to the mana burned, and reduces healing done to the target by (.-)%% for (.-)%.%s*$","魔法锁现在还会尝试从目标身上偷取一个有益魔法效果，持续至多2分钟。\n\n若成功，还会燃烧其{{1}}点法力值，造成相当于所燃烧法力值的伤害，并使目标受到的治疗效果降低{{2}}%，持续{{3}}。"}
