T[1565]={"^Increases the Spell Power of your Shadow Damage Spells by (.-)%% of your Strength, and your Spell Hit Rating by (.-)%% of your Strength%.\n\n|cffffffffCultists can build toward Strength for a melee hybrid or tank playstyle, Intellect and Spell Power for a caster playstyle, or Spirit and Spell Power for a healer playstyle%.|r%s*$","使你的暗影伤害法术的法术强度提高相当于力量的{{1}}%，并使你的法术命中等级提高相当于力量的{{2}}%。\n\n|cffffffff邪教徒可以专精力量来走近战混合或坦克玩法，专精智力和法术强度来走施法者玩法，或专精精神和法术强度来走治疗者玩法。|r"}
