T[1572]={"^Increases your Holy Spell Damage by (.-)%% of your Agility, and your Melee Hit Rating and Expertise Rating by (.-)%% of your Intellect%.\n\nMonks can build Agility to empower their Physical and Weapon attacks, or Intellect and Spell Power to empower their Holy Damage effects%.\n\nAs masters of different styles of combat, monks gain special benefits when using specific weapons, and have a different primary attack based on whether they choose to fight Unarmed, with Dual Weapons, with a Staff, or with a Long Blade %(Two%-Handed Sword or Polearm%)%.%s*$","使你的神圣法术伤害提高相当于敏捷的{{1}}%，并使你的近战命中等级和精准提高相当于智力的{{2}}%。\n\n武僧可以提高敏捷来增强其物理和武器攻击，或提高智力和法术强度来增强其神圣伤害效果。\n\n作为精通多种战斗风格的大师，武僧在使用特定武器时会获得特殊增益，并根据选择徒手、双持、法杖或长刃（双手剑或长柄武器）战斗而拥有不同的主要攻击。"}
