T[1600]={"^Grants direct Nature Damage dealt an 8%-16%% chance to make your next |cffffffffCrackling Surge|r instant, incur no cooldown, and generate 50%% less Static%. Stacks (.-) times%. Each use consumes a stack%.\n\nChance based on |cffcc99ffStatic|r level%.%s*$","使你的自然直接伤害有8-16%的几率令你下一次|cffffffff噼啪灼烧|r变为瞬发、无冷却时间，且产生的静电减少50%。可叠加{{1}}次。每次使用消耗一层叠加。\n\n该几率取决于|cffcc99ff静电|r的层数。"}
T[1601]={"^Allows the periodic damage effect from your Ignite, Blaze and Scalding Brand spells to critically strike%.%s*$","使你的点燃、烈焰和灼热印记法术的持续性伤害效果能够造成爆击。"}
