T[1624]={"^When are brought below 10%% of your Maximum Health, you prime yourself to explode after a (.-) delay, knocking nearby enemies into the air and dealing Fire damage to them%.\n\nTaking damage will delay the explosion, but it will trigger after you die regardless%.%s*$","当你的生命值被降至最大生命值的10%以下时，你会准备在{{1}}延迟后爆炸，将附近敌人击飞并对其造成火焰伤害。\n\n受到伤害会推迟爆炸，但你死亡时它仍会触发。"}
