T[3084]={"^\nll raid and party members within (.-) yards by (.-)%. Lasts (.-)%.%s*$","\n使{{1}}码内的队伍和团队成员获得{{2}}点治疗。持续{{3}}。"}
T[3085]={"^Only one Curse per Warlock can be active on any one target%.%s*$","同一目标身上只能存在一名术士的诅咒。"}
T[3086]={"^This damage is dealt slowly at first, and builds up as the Curse reaches its full duration%. Only one Curse per Warlock can be active on any one target%.%s*$","该伤害起初生效缓慢，随着诅咒接近其完整持续时间而逐渐提高。同一目标身上只能存在一名术士的诅咒。"}
T[3087]={"^Forces the target to speak in Demonic, increasing the casting time of all spells by (.-)%%%. Lasts (.-)%.%s*$","迫使目标说恶魔语，使所有法术的施法时间延长{{1}}%。持续{{2}}。"}
