T[3089]={"^Conjured items disappear if logged out for more than 15 minutes%.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted%.%s*$","如果离线超过15分钟，魔法制造的物品将会消失。\n\n该技能可在变形状态下使用。"}
