T[3108]={"^\nSummons a Grounding Totem with (.-) health at the feet of the caster that will redirect one harmful spell from the caster to itself, destroying the totem%. Will not redirect area of effect spells%. Lasts (.-)%.%s*$","\n在施法者脚下召唤一个生命值为{{1}}的根基图腾，它会将施法者受到的一次有害法术重定向到自身，并摧毁图腾。不会重定向范围法术。持续{{2}}。"}
T[3109]={"^\nThe caster is surrounded by (.-) globes of water, granting (.-) mana per 5 sec%. When a spell, melee or ranged attack hits the caster, (.-) mana is restored to the caster%. This expends one water globe%.  Only one globe will activate every few seconds%. Lasts (.-)%.%s*$","\n施法者被{{1}}个水球环绕，每5秒为其提供{{2}}点法力值。当一个法术、近战或远程攻击命中施法者时，会恢复{{3}}点法力值。这会消耗一个水球。每隔几秒只有一个水球会生效。持续{{4}}。"}
T[3110]={"^\nProtects the target with an earthen shield%. Lasts (.-) or (.-) charges%. \n\nAttacks heal the shielded target for (.-)and reduce casting or channel time lost when damaged by (.-)%%%.%s*$","\n用大地之盾保护目标，持续{{1}}或直到{{2}}次充能耗尽。\n\n攻击会为受到护盾保护的目标恢复{{3}}点生命值，并使受到伤害时损失的施法或引导时间缩短{{4}}%。"}
T[3111]={"^\nImbue your weapon, increasing attack power by 20%. The attack power granted is doubled for two%-handed weapons%. @ext:You only gain 33%% of the attack power while your Primary Stat is Intellect or Spirit%. This effect lasts for 2 hours%.:ext@%s*$","\n为你的武器注能，使攻击强度提高20。双手武器的攻击强度加成翻倍。你只有在主属性为智力或精神时才能获得33%的攻击强度。该效果持续2小时。"}
T[3112]={"^ increasing total Spell power by (.-) and increasing Spell critical strike chance by (.-)%%%. Each auto attack and melee ability causes (.-) to (.-) additional fire damage, based on the speed of the weapon%. Slower weapons cause more fire damage per swing%. This effect lasts for 2 hours%.%s*$"," 使总法术强度提高{{1}}，法术爆击几率提高{{2}}%。每次自动攻击和近战技能都会基于武器速度造成{{3}}到{{4}}点额外火焰伤害。越慢的武器每次挥击造成的火焰伤害越高。该效果持续2小时。"}
T[3113]={"^ increasing total Spell power by (.-)%. Each auto attack and melee ability causes (.-) to (.-) additional fire damage, based on the speed of the weapon%. Slower weapons cause more fire damage per swing%. This effect lasts for 2 hours%.%s*$"," 使总法术强度提高{{1}}。每次自动攻击和近战技能都会基于武器速度造成{{2}}到{{3}}点额外火焰伤害。越慢的武器每次挥击造成的火焰伤害越高。该效果持续2小时。"}
