T[3115]={"^Each hit has a 20%% chance of dealing additional damage equal to two extra attacks with (.-) extra attack power%.%s*$","每次命中都有20%的几率造成额外伤害，相当于以{{1}}点额外攻击强度进行两次额外攻击。"}
