T[3117]={"^ Increases healing done by (.-) and each direct heal has a (.-)%% chance to proc Earthliving on the target, healing an additional (.-) over (.-)%. This effect lasts for 2 hours%.%s*$"," 使你的治疗量提高{{1}}，每次直接治疗都有{{2}}%的几率在目标身上触发大地生命，在{{4}}内额外治疗{{3}}。该效果持续2小时。"}
