T[3221]={"^\nPlace a fire trap that explodes when an enemy approaches, causing (.-) to (.-) Fire damage and burning all enemies for (.-) additional Fire damage over (.-) to all within (.-) yards%. Trap will exist for (.-)%. Only one trap can be active at a time%.%s*$","\n放置一个火焰陷阱，当敌人靠近时爆炸，造成{{1}}到{{2}}点火焰伤害，并在{{4}}内对{{5}}码范围内的所有敌人造成{{3}}点额外火焰伤害。陷阱将持续{{6}}。同一时间只能激活一个陷阱。"}
