T[5845]={"^Enraged over Ohgan's death%.\n\nAttack speed increased by (.-)%%%.\n\nBloodlord Mandokir dropped his defense, causing him to take (.-)%% more damage%.%s*$","因奥根之死而激怒。\n\n攻击速度提高 {{1}}%。\n\n血领主曼多基尔放弃了防御，使其受到的伤害提高 {{2}}%。"}
