T[5847]={"^Flamegore enrages and attacks in a reckless flurry of strikes, increasing his attack speed by (.-)%% and causes him to take (.-)%% more damage for the duration of his assault%.%s*$","弗莱格尔陷入狂怒，以鲁莽的连击发动攻击，使其攻击速度提高 {{1}}%，并在其猛攻期间受到的伤害提高 {{2}}%。"}
T[5848]={"^Attack speed increased by (.-)%%%.\nSpell Cooldowns reduced by (.-)%%%.%s*$","攻击速度提高 {{1}}%。\n法术冷却时间缩短 {{2}}%。"}
