T[5852]={"^Grand Widow Faerlina fell into a blood frenzy%.\n\nPhysical damage dealt increased by (.-)%%%.\nAttack speed increased by (.-)%%%.\n\nSatisfying her lust for blood removes this effect%.%s*$","大寡妇费尔琳娜陷入了血之狂热。\n\n造成的物理伤害提高 {{1}}%。\n攻击速度提高 {{2}}%。\n\n满足她的嗜血欲望可移除此效果。"}
