T[5872]={"^Absorbing up to (.-) Magic damage%.\n\nInflicting (.-)%% weapon damage with both weapons per (.-) seconds to enemies within 5 yards%.%s*$","最多吸收 {{1}} 点魔法伤害。\n\n双手武器每 {{3}} 秒对 5 码内的敌人造成 {{2}}% 的武器伤害。"}
