T[5878]={"^The spirit fell into a rage, increasing his damage dealt by (.-)%%, attack speed by (.-)%% and movement speed by (.-)%% every (.-) seconds%. Stacks up to 200 times%.\n\nThe sound of the Gong of the Bear God may calms him down%.%s*$","该灵魂陷入狂怒，每 {{4}} 秒使其造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%、攻击速度提高 {{2}}%、移动速度提高 {{3}}%。最多叠加 200 次。\n\n熊神之锣的声音可以使他平静下来。"}
T[5879]={"^Enraged over the death of a \"Little One\"%.\n\nAttackspeed increased by (.-)%%%.\nDamage dealt increased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","因一名\"小家伙\"的死亡而激怒。\n\n攻击速度提高 {{1}}%。\n造成的伤害提高 {{2}}%。"}
T[5880]={"^(.-) Fire damage inflicted every second%.\n\nWhen Flame Shock is removed by any means, a pit of molten magma erupts beneath the target%.%s*$","每秒造成 {{1}} 点火焰伤害。\n\n当烈焰震击以任何方式被移除时，目标脚下会喷发一座熔岩池。"}
