T[5884]={"^Your soul has been riped out of your body%.\n\nKill your soul before Hex Lord Malacrass consumes it!\n\nYou can help other players killing their souls but your damage against other players souls is greatly reduced%.\n\nHalf the damage your soul takes is also inflicted on you%.%s*$","你的灵魂已从身体中被扯出。\n\n在巫术领主玛拉卡斯吞噬你的灵魂之前杀死它！\n\n你可以通过杀死其他玩家的灵魂来帮助他们，但你对其他玩家灵魂造成的伤害会大幅降低。\n\n你的灵魂受到的伤害有一半也会作用于你。"}
T[5885]={"^Disabled%.\n\n(.-) Holy damage inflicted every second%.%s*$","已禁用。\n\n每秒造成 {{1}} 点神圣伤害。"}
