T[5887]={"^Impaled%.\n\nBleeding for (.-)%% maximum health every second%.%s*$","被穿刺。\n\n每秒因流血损失最大生命值的 {{1}}%。"}
T[5888]={"^Zul'jin fell into a blood rage, increasing attack speed and damage inflicted by (.-)%%%.\n\nRapidly regenerating health while below 10%% maximum health%. The health regenerated increases as lower Zul'jin's health becomes%.%s*$","祖尔金陷入了血怒，攻击速度和造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%。\n\n生命值低于 10% 时快速恢复生命值。祖尔金的生命值越低，恢复的生命值越多。"}
