T[5902]={"^Send into a nightmare%.\n\nYou left behind your body%. You must find a way out of the Nightmare to reunite with it%.\n\nAll damage and healing you and your body receive is shared with each other%.%s*$","被送入噩梦。\n\n你已留下自己的身体。你必须找到离开噩梦的方法才能与它重聚。\n\n你和你的身体受到的所有伤害和治疗都会彼此共享。"}
T[5903]={"^Reaching its critical mass, the Infernal transformed into an Abyssal, periodically causing a fiery Eruption to be expelled from its body%.%s*$","到达临界质量后，地狱火转化为深渊魔，周期性地以自身躯体为代价喷发火焰。"}
