T[5906]={"^Absorbing up to (.-)%% of maximum health in damage%.\nImmune to interrupts%.\n\nWhen the shield absorb damage, it has a chance to fling a Bone at a nearby enemy%.%s*$","最多吸收相当于最大生命值 {{1}}% 的伤害。\n免疫打断。\n\n当护盾吸收伤害时，有几率向附近敌人投掷一根白骨。"}
T[5907]={"^Absorbing all damage taken up to a maximum of (.-)%% of the casters health%.\n\nWhile the shield is active the caster regenerates (.-)%% maximum health every (.-) seconds%.\n\nIf the shield is depleted a Tidal Burst inflicts a large amount of Frost damage to all enemies%.%s*$","吸收受到的所有伤害，最多不超过施法者生命值的 {{1}}%。\n\n护盾激活期间，施法者每 {{3}} 秒恢复其最大生命值的 {{2}}%。\n\n如果护盾被耗尽，一道潮汐爆发会对所有敌人造成大量冰霜伤害。"}
T[5908]={"^(.-) Fire damage inflicted every second%.\n\nIf this effect is removed by any means, a Pool of Boiling Blood forms underneath the target%.\n\nIf the blood is a puddle, on Mythic and Ascended difficulty it is animated into a Living Blood%.%s*$","每秒造成 {{1}} 点火焰伤害。\n\n如果该效果以任何方式被移除，目标脚下会形成一滩沸腾之血。\n\n如果血液只是一滩水洼，在史诗和飞升难度下它会活化成为活体血液。"}
T[5909]={"^Disabled%.\n\n(.-) Holy damage inflicted every second%.\n\nEmpowered: Lasts forever%.%s*$","已禁用。\n\n每秒造成 {{1}} 点神圣伤害。\n\n强化：永久持续。"}
