T[5922]={"^Your Luck grows with every fallen enemy%. Entering a safe zone or dying will reset your luck%.', 'Your Luck grows with every fallen enemy%. Entering a safe zone or dying will reset your luck%.%s*$","你的幸运值会随每个倒下的敌人而增长。进入安全区域或死亡都会重置你的幸运值。"}
