T[6166]={"^Increases move and swim speed by (.-)%%%.%s*$","移动和游泳速度提高 {{1}}%。"}
T[6167]={"^Every |cffFF9900(.-) seconds|r, a Screaming Skull spawns nearby, moving towards your position, exploding upon collision or reaching its destination for |cffFF9900(.-)%%|r of your maximum health in Shadow damage%.%s*$","每 |cffFF9900{{1}} 秒|r，附近会出现一个尖啸骷髅，朝你的位置移动，在碰撞或到达目的地时爆炸，造成相当于你最大生命值 |cffFF9900{{2}}%|r 的暗影伤害。"}
T[6168]={"^Attack Speed increased by (.-)%%%.\nCasting Speed increased by (.-)%%%.\nMovement Speed increased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","攻击速度提高 {{1}}%。\n施法速度提高 {{2}}%。\n移动速度提高 {{3}}%。"}
T[6169]={"^\n|cffFF0000Mythic 7%+|r\n\nYou are surrounded by a magnetic field%. Every |cffFF9900(.-) seconds|r your polarity shifts%.\n\nEvery |cffFF9900(.-) seconds|r player with opposite polarities inflict |cffFF9900(.-)%%|r maximum health damage to each other and knock each other aside%.\n\nPlayer with the same polarity do not effect each other%.%s*$","\n|cffFF0000史诗 7+|r\n\n你被磁场环绕。每 |cffFF9900{{1}} 秒|r 你的极性会改变。\n\n每 |cffFF9900{{2}} 秒|r，极性相反的玩家会对彼此造成相当于最大生命值 |cffFF9900{{3}}%|r 的伤害并将彼此击退。\n\n极性相同的玩家不会互相影响。"}
T[6170]={"^You are charged with negative energy%.\n\nPeriodically repel nearby positively charged player%.%s*$","你被负能量充能。\n\n周期性地排斥附近带正电的玩家。"}
T[6171]={"^Increases speed by (.-)%%%.\n\nThe Crimson Skyblazer is a Season 7 exclusive from the Ethereal Box of Wares%.%s*$","速度提高 {{1}}%。\n\n赤红天行者是第 7 赛季专属奖励，来自虚灵货物箱。"}
T[6172]={"^Your physical damage taken is reduced by (.-)%% %((.-)%% vs players%)%. \nCooldown of Shadow Cleave %(Demonic Rage%) reduced by 100%%%.\nDealing damage with Shadow Cleave %(Demonic Rage%) increases the damage of your next direct damage Fire or Shadow spell by (.-)%% %((.-)%% vs players%)%.%s*$","你受到的物理伤害降低 {{1}}%（对玩家为 {{2}}%）。\n暗影顺劈（恶魔之怒）的冷却时间缩短 100%。\n以暗影顺劈（恶魔之怒）造成伤害会使你下一个直接伤害的火焰或暗影法术的伤害提高 {{3}}%（对玩家为 {{4}}%）。"}
T[6173]={"^Your Victory Rush now reduces your Physical Damage taken by (.-)%% for the next hit, but it no longer heals you%. Also increases the damage of your Victory Rush by (.-)%%%.%s*$","你的胜利在望现在会使你受到的物理伤害在下次命中时降低 {{1}}%，但不再治疗你。同时使你的胜利在望伤害提高 {{2}}%。"}
T[6174]={"^Casting Frostbolt on a target affected by your Ignite consumes the Ignite effect, creating a burst of hot steam that interrupts their spell casting and prevents any spell in that school from being cast for 2 sec, and makes them drop their weapons for 2 seconds%.%s*$","对一个受你点燃影响的目标施放寒冰箭会消耗点燃效果，制造一股炽热蒸汽爆发，打断其施法并使该系法术在 2 秒内无法施放，同时使其在 2 秒内掉落武器。"}
T[6175]={"^While affected by Last Stand, Stagger from your Tactical Mastery capstone staggers an additional 10%% of damage taken%.%s*$","当你受到破釜沉舟影响时，你的战术掌握终极天赋的醉拳会额外延迟承受 10% 的伤害。"}
T[6176]={"^Your Healing Touch criticals create a stack of Garden of Growth on your target%. When Garden of Growth reaches 3 stacks, all Living Seeds within 10 yards instantly bloom%. Living Seed is not consumed by this effect%.%s*$","你的治疗之触爆击会在目标身上生成一层生长花园。当生长花园达到 3 层时，10 码内的所有生命之种会立即绽放。此效果不会消耗生命之种。"}
T[6177]={"^You have been touched by the Garden of Growth%.%s*$","你已被生长花园触碰。"}
T[6178]={"^When cast on yourself, your Thorns ability has a chance to deal 100%% additional damage to all nearby targets%. This effect cannot occur more than once every 1 second%.%s*$","当你对自己施放荆棘时，你有几率对所有附近目标造成 100% 的额外伤害。此效果每 1 秒只能触发一次。"}
T[6179]={"^Your Deep Freeze makes the target vulnerable to your Fire spells, making them guaranteed to critically strike but also to thaw the Deep Freeze effect%.%s*$","你的深度冻结使目标对你的火焰法术易伤，保证其被爆击，但也会解冻深度冻结效果。"}
T[6180]={"^Reduces the cooldown of your Feint ability by 4 seconds%. Using Feint allows the use of Riposte for 6 seconds and increases its critical strike chance by 100%%%.%s*$","使你的佯攻冷却时间缩短 4 秒。使用佯攻后可以在 6 秒内使用还击，并使其爆击几率提高 100%。"}
T[6181]={"^Allows the use of Riposte%.%s*$","允许使用还击。"}
T[6182]={"^Teaches you Ethereal Form%. Ethereal Form reduces your Physical damage taken by 5%% and reduces your threat generated by 10%%, but increases your Magic damage taken by 10%%%.%s*$","教你虚灵形态。虚灵形态使你受到的物理伤害降低 5%，产生的威胁值降低 10%，但受到的魔法伤害提高 10%。"}
T[6183]={"^Physical damage taken reduced by (.-)%%%.\nThreat dealt reduced by (.-)%%%.\nMagic damage taken increased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","受到的物理伤害降低 {{1}}%。\n造成的威胁值降低 {{2}}%。\n受到的魔法伤害提高 {{3}}%。"}
T[6184]={"^Melee and ranged attacks apply a stack of |cff67BCFFNecrosis|r inflicting |cff80528CShadow Damage|r every second and reduces healing received%.%s*$","近战和远程攻击会施加一层 |cff67BCFF坏死|r，每秒造成 |cff80528C暗影伤害|r 并降低受到的治疗效果。"}
T[6185]={"^Your Whirlwind ability will apply your Rend %(if known%) to targets that are hit and has its maximum target limit increased by 5%.%s*$","你的旋风斩技能会将你的撕裂（若已学会）施加于被命中的目标，并使其最大目标上限提高 5。"}
T[6186]={"^Increases the damage of your next Shockwave by (.-)%% %((.-)%% versus players%)%. Shockwave is further empowered on 3 stacks%.%s*$","使你的下一个冲击波的伤害提高 {{1}}%（对玩家为 {{2}}%）。冲击波在 3 层时会被进一步强化。"}
T[6187]={"^(.-)%% increased melee attack power%.\n(.-)%% increased melee attack speed%.\n(.-)%% increased movement speed%.%s*$","近战攻击强度提高 {{1}}%。\n近战攻击速度提高 {{2}}%。\n移动速度提高 {{3}}%。"}
T[6188]={"^You will lose (.-)%% of your maximum health at the end of the duration if you did not kill an enemy that granted experience or honor%.%s*$","如果在持续时间结束前没有击杀提供经验值或荣誉的敌人，你将失去最大生命值的 {{1}}%。"}
