T[6257]={"^Allows casting Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning%. These spells cannot miss while while in Tree of Wrath%.\n\nYour Lightning Bolt applies Lightning Rod to your target%.\n\nIf your Primary Stat is Spirit, shapeshifting into Tree of Wrath will free you from all movement impairing effects%.%s*$","允许施放闪电箭和闪电链。处于愤怒之树形态时，这些法术不会未命中。\n\n你的闪电箭会使目标获得避雷针。\n\n如果你的主属性为精神，变形为愤怒之树将解除你身上所有降低移动速度的效果。"}
T[6258]={"^\nTree of Life is transformed into |cFFFFFFFFTree of Wrath|r%.\n\nIf you know Chain Heal, you will learn |cFFFFFFFFLiving Lightning|r%.\n\nWhile in Tree of Wrath, your Lightning Bolt applies |cFFFFFFFFLightning Rod|r and your direct nature healing spell criticals will cast lightning bolt on your |cFFFFFFFFLightning Rod target|r%. Critically healing an ally with Lesser Healing Wave, Healing Wave or Chain Heal reduce the cooldown of Living Lightning by 2 seconds%.%s*$","\n生命之树会转化为|cFFFFFFFF愤怒之树|r。\n\n如果你掌握治疗链，你将学会|cFFFFFFFF活体闪电|r。\n\n处于愤怒之树形态时，你的闪电箭会施加|cFFFFFFFF避雷针|r，且你的自然系直接治疗法术爆击时会朝你的|cFFFFFFFF避雷针|r目标施放闪电箭。使用次级治疗波、治疗波或治疗链对盟友造成爆击治疗，会使活体闪电的冷却时间缩短 2 秒。"}
