T[6862]={"^Combat parachute deployed! Reduces your fall speed, increases Hunter Shot critical strike chance by (.-)%%, and Orbital Arrow Strike damage by (.-)%%%.%s*$","战斗降落伞已展开！降低你的下落速度，使猎人射击的爆击几率提高 {{1}}%，轨道箭矢打击的伤害提高 {{2}}%。"}
T[6863]={"^Disengages you from combat, jumping directly above the battlefield, making you jump upwards instead of backwards%.%s*$","使你脱离战斗，直接跃过战场上方，让你向上跳跃而不是向后跳跃。"}
T[6864]={"^Calls in an Orbital Arrow Strike dealing (.-)%% weapon damage up to 5 nearby targets%.%s*$","呼叫一次轨道箭矢打击，对最多 5 个附近目标造成 {{1}}% 的武器伤害。"}
