T[6866]={"^Your next Wrath applies Entangling Roots to players or Insect Swarm to monsters%.%s*$","你的下一次愤怒会对玩家施加纠缠根须，或对怪物施加虫群。"}
T[6867]={"^Your next Starfire or Starsurge applies a 2 second stun to players or Moonfire to monsters if known%.%s*$","你的下一个星火术或星涌术会使玩家昏迷 2 秒，或在你知道该法术时对生物施加月火术。"}
T[6868]={"^Your next Mangle %(Bear%) reduces the target's armor by 20%% for 20 seconds%.%s*$","你的下一个裂伤（熊）会使目标的护甲降低 20%，持续 20 秒。"}
