T[6908]={"^Empowers your next ability:\n\n%- |cFFFFFFFFDevouring Plague|r: Deals its periodic damage twice as fast, lasts for 6 more seconds, and causes a shadowy explosion, but has a 12 second cooldown%.\n\n%- |cFFFFFFFFVampiric Touch|r: Causes you to deal (.-)%% increased Shadow damage and (.-)%% increased Vampiric Touch damage to the target for 15 seconds%. \n\n%- |cFFFFFFFFMind Blast|r: Deals (.-)%% increased damage and grants you Psychic Surge, increasing the damage of Mind Flay and Mind Sear by 25%%%. This bonus is reduced by 1%% for each time they deal damage%.%s*$","强化你的下一个技能：\n\n- |cFFFFFFFF噬灵瘟疫|r：其周期性伤害的生效速度加快一倍，持续时间延长 6 秒，并引发一次暗影爆炸，但冷却时间为 12 秒。\n\n- |cFFFFFFFF吸血鬼之触|r：使你在 15 秒内对目标造成的暗影伤害提高 {{1}}%，吸血鬼之触的伤害提高 {{2}}%。 \n\n- |cFFFFFFFF心灵震爆|r：造成的伤害提高 {{3}}%，并赋予你心灵涌动，使精神鞭笞和精神灼烧的伤害提高 25%。该加成每次造成伤害时降低 1%。"}
