T[6952]={"^|cFFFFFFFFExorcism|r: Causes a holy explosion hitting up to 5 targets within 5 yards granting a stack of |cFFFFFFFFDivine Power|r per target hit%. And procs |cFFFFFFFFLight of the Ascended|r%.\n\n|cFFFFFFFFHoly Shock|r: Guaranteed to critically strike and increases its damage and healing done by 20%%%. And procs |cFFFFFFFFLight of the Ascended|r%.%s*$","|cFFFFFFFF驱邪术|r：引发一次神圣爆炸，击中 5 码内最多 5 个目标，每击中一个目标便赋予一层|cFFFFFFFF神圣之力|r，并触发|cFFFFFFFF飞升者之光|r。\n\n|cFFFFFFFF神圣震击|r：必定爆击，并使其伤害和治疗量提高 20%，且触发|cFFFFFFFF飞升者之光|r。"}
