T[6959]={"^Smite: Deals 50%% additional damage%.\n\nExorcism: Increases all Holy damage you deal to the target by 5%% for 10 seconds%.\n\nHoly Shock: Guaranteed to critically strike and increases its damage and healing done by 20%%%.%s*$","惩击：造成 50% 的额外伤害。\n\n驱邪术：使你在 10 秒内对目标造成的神圣伤害提高 5%。\n\n神圣震击：必定爆击，并使其伤害和治疗量提高 20%。"}
