T[6961]={"^Devastate: Deals (.-)%% additional damage and reduces the target's armor by an additional (.-)%% for (.-)%.\n\nRiposte: Increases the damage staggered by Tactical Mastery capstone by 10%% for 10 seconds%.\n\nShield Slam: Attempts to dispel (.-) additional effect from the target and increases your block value by (.-)%% for (.-)%.%s*$","毁灭打击：造成额外 {{1}}% 的伤害，并使目标的护甲在 {{3}} 内额外降低 {{2}}%。\n\n还击：使战术掌握终极天赋延迟的伤害提高 10%，持续 10 秒。\n\n盾牌猛击：尝试驱散目标身上 {{4}} 个额外效果，并使你的格挡值在 {{6}} 内提高 {{5}}%。"}
T[6962]={"^Devastate: Deals 50%% additional damage and reduces the target's armor by an additional 10%% for 6 seconds%.\n\nRiposte: Increases the damage staggered by Tactical Mastery capstone by 10%% for 10 seconds%.\n\nShield Slam: Attempts to dispel 1 additional effect from the target and increases your block value by 10%% for 12 seconds%.\nDivine Storm: Increases your Armor and Holy spell damage by 30%% of your Strength for 5 seconds%.%s*$","毁灭打击：造成额外 50% 的伤害，并使目标的护甲在 6 秒内额外降低 10%。\n\n还击：使战术掌握终极天赋延迟的伤害提高 10%，持续 10 秒。\n\n盾牌猛击：尝试驱散目标身上 1 个额外效果，并使你的格挡值在 12 秒内提高 10%。\n神圣风暴：在 5 秒内使你的护甲和神圣法术伤害提高，数值相当于你力量的 30%。"}
T[6963]={"^Devastate: Deals 50%% additional damage and reduces the target's armor by an additional 10%% for 6 seconds%.\n\nRiposte: Increases the damage staggered by Tactical Mastery capstone by 10%% for 10 seconds%.\n\nShield Slam: Attempts to dispel 1 additional effect from the target and increases your block value by 10%% for 12 seconds%.%s*$","毁灭打击：造成额外 50% 的伤害，并使目标的护甲在 6 秒内额外降低 10%。\n\n还击：使战术掌握终极天赋延迟的伤害提高 10%，持续 10 秒。\n\n盾牌猛击：尝试驱散目标身上 1 个额外效果，并使你的格挡值在 12 秒内提高 10%。"}
