T[7010]={"^Increases your healing power by (.-)%% of your attack power%.%s*$","使你的治疗强度提高，数值相当于攻击强度的 {{1}}%。"}
T[7011]={"^\nDefensive Stance is transformed into |cFFFFFFFFPhalanx Stance|r%. Sinister Strike is transformed into |cFFFFFFFFThrust|r%. While Bloodrage is active, your Thrust applies a stack of |cFFFFFFFFPhalanx Strike|r%. Shield Slam is transformed into |cFFFFFFFFShield Strike|r%. You learn |cFFFFFFFFJavelin|r%. Allows the use of Polearm and Shield%. Effects that do not work with Titan's Grip do not work with Hoplite%.%s*$","\n防御姿态转化为 |cFFFFFFFF方阵姿态|r。邪恶攻击转化为 |cFFFFFFFF突刺|r。血性狂暴激活期间，你的突刺会施加一层 |cFFFFFFFF方阵打击|r。盾牌猛击转化为 |cFFFFFFFF盾击|r。你学会 |cFFFFFFFF标枪|r。允许使用长柄武器和盾牌。对泰坦之握无效的效果同样对方阵步兵无效。"}
T[7012]={"^Increases the damage of your Sinister Strike by (.-)%% and reduces the energy cost by (.-)%. Refreshing Bloodrage clears all stacks%.%s*$","使你的邪恶攻击的伤害提高 {{1}}%，能量消耗降低 {{2}}。刷新血性狂暴会清除所有层数。"}
