T[7015]={"^Skewered by a Javelin, taking (.-)%% %((.-)%% versus players%) additional damage from from the caster's Colossus Smash%.%s*$","被标枪钉穿，从施法者的巨人打击中受到 {{1}}%（对玩家 {{2}}%）的额外伤害。"}
