T[7019]={"^Claw, Shred, Ravage and Mangle deal additional Fire damage, cost (.-) less energy, restore 7%% of your mana%.%s*$","撕碎、撕咬、毁灭和裂伤造成额外的火焰伤害，消耗的能量减少 {{1}}，并为你恢复 7% 的法力值。"}
T[7020]={"^Searing Pain now awards 1 Combo Point, deals (.-)%% increased damage has a (.-)%% reduced cast time%. Stores up to 5 charges%s*$","灼热之痛现在提供 1 个连击点数，造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%，施法时间缩短 {{2}}%。最多储存 5 层充能。"}
