T[7025]={"^Lowers the global cooldown of your next Cat Form shapeshift, and makes it trigger Cat%-a%-clysm%.%s*$","使你的下一次猎豹形态变形的公共冷却时间缩短，并使其触发 Cat-a-clysm。"}
T[7026]={"^At 5 stacks the global cooldown of your next Cat Form shapeshift is removed, and it triggers Cataclysm%.%s*$","达到 5 层时，你的下一次猎豹形态变形的公共冷却时间被移除，并会触发 Cat-a-clysm。"}
