T[7032]={"^Your Bloodthirst applies Blood Venom, dealing Nature damage over time and increasing the damage taken by your Rogue Poisons by 30%% per stack%. This effect stacks up to 3 times%.\n\nDealing damage with Rend, Garrote or Rupture applies a stack Internal Bleeding to the target, increasing the damage of your Hemorrhage by 5%%%. This effect stacks up to 20 times%.%s*$","你的嗜血会施加血毒，造成持续性的自然伤害，并使你的潜行者毒药造成的伤害每层提高 30%。该效果最多叠加 3 次。\n\n用撕裂、锁喉或割裂造成伤害会为目标施加一层内出血，使你的出血的伤害每层提高 5%。该效果最多叠加 20 次。"}
T[7033]={"^Increases the damage of your melee combo point generating abilities by (.-)%%%.%s*$","使你的近战连击点数生成技能的伤害提高 {{1}}%。"}
T[7034]={"^Deals  (.-) Nature damage every 3 seconds%.%s*$","每 3 秒造成 {{1}} 点自然伤害。"}
T[7035]={"^Mortal Strike and Chimera Shot deal (.-)%% and Envenom and Deadly Throw deals (.-)%% more damage%.%s*$","致死打击和奇美拉射击的伤害提高 {{1}}%，毒伤和致命投掷的伤害提高 {{2}}%。"}
