T[7037]={"^Deadly Poison deals (.-)%% and Rogue bleeds deal (.-)%% more damage%.%s*$","致命毒药造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%，潜行者的流血效果造成的伤害提高 {{2}}%。"}
T[7038]={"^Chimera Shot, Envenom, Deadly Throw and Mortal Strike consume 5 stacks to grant you Venom Coated Blade%.%s*$","奇美拉射击、毒伤、致命投掷和致死打击会消耗 5 层效果，赋予你淬毒之刃。"}
T[7039]={"^Envenom preserves (.-) combo points and increases the damage done by Warrior abilities by (.-)%%%.%s*$","毒伤会保留 {{1}} 个连击点数，并使战士技能造成的伤害提高 {{2}}%。"}
T[7040]={"^Increases the damage done of Explosive Shot by (.-)%% and critical strike chance of Explosive Shot by (.-)%% to targets affected by your Living Bomb%.%s*$","使爆炸射击对受你活动炸弹影响的目标造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%，爆击几率提高 {{2}}%。"}
