T[7079]={"^Bleeding for (.-) Frost damage plus a percentage of weapon damage every (.-) seconds%.\nIncreases the Frost damage taken from the caster by (.-)%%%. Additionally, increases damage taken from your Fireball and Lighthing Bolt by (.-)%%%.%s*$","每 {{2}} 秒因流血受到 {{1}} 点冰霜伤害外加一定比例的武器伤害。\n使目标从施法者处受到的冰霜伤害提高 {{3}}%。此外，使目标受到你的火球术和闪电箭的伤害提高 {{4}}%。"}
