T[8026]={"^Movement speed reduced by (.-)%% and armor reduced by (.-)%%%.%s*$","移动速度降低 {{1}}%，护甲降低 {{2}}%。"}
T[8027]={"^Increases the haste of your Undead by (.-)%%%.%s*$","使你的亡灵随从的急速提高 {{1}}%。"}
T[8028]={"^Deals Shadowstrike damage to up to (.-) nearby targets%.%s*$","对最多 {{1}} 个附近目标造成暗影打击伤害。"}
