T[8034]={"^|cffffffffGlacial Tap|r now generates an additional (.-) Runic Power and its cost is reduced by (.-)%%, but its cooldown is increased by (.-) sec%.%s*$","|cffffffff冰霜之触|r 现在额外产生 {{1}} 点符文能量，其消耗降低 {{2}}%，但冷却时间延长 {{3}} 秒。"}
