T[8038]={"^At the end of the duration, the target takes Nature Damage%.%s*$","持续时间结束时，目标受到自然伤害。"}
T[8039]={"^Increases the effect of your abilities that Invoke Gonk by (.-)%%, and reduces their cooldowns by (.-)%. Increases damage of summoned creatures by (.-)%%%.\n\nYour abilities that Invoke Gonk increase your attack and casting speed 8%% for (.-), stacking 3 times%.%s*$","使你「祈求贡克」技能的效果提高 {{1}}%，并使其冷却时间缩短 {{2}}。使召唤生物造成的伤害提高 {{3}}%。\n\n你「祈求贡克」的技能会使你的攻击和施法速度提高 8%，持续 {{4}}，可叠加 3 次。"}
