T[8216]={"^(.-) Shadow damage inflicted every second for (.-)%.\nMovement speed increased by (.-)%%%.\nFleeing in fear%.%s*$","每秒造成 {{1}} 点暗影伤害，持续 {{2}}。\n移动速度提高 {{3}}%。\n因恐惧而逃跑。"}
