T[8218]={"^Deals (.-) damage every (.-) sec%.\n\nDamage against Undead increased by 100%%%.\n\nYour eyes tingle as you begin to understand the world from a different perspective%.%.%.%s*$","每 {{2}} 秒造成 {{1}} 点伤害。\n\n对亡灵造成的伤害提高 100%。\n\n你的双眼刺痛，开始以不同的视角理解这个世界……"}
T[8219]={"^Causes (.-) Shadow damage every 1 sec%.  When Lucifron's Touch expires, it deals  (.-) Shadow damage to allies around the target%.%s*$","每 1 秒造成 {{1}} 点暗影伤害。当路西弗隆之触结束时，对目标周围的盟友造成 {{2}} 点暗影伤害。"}
T[8220]={"^(.-) Fire damage inflicted every (.-) sec%.\n\nMovement speed decreased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","每 {{2}} 秒造成 {{1}} 点火焰伤害。\n\n移动速度降低 {{3}}%。"}
