T[8223]={"^Being incinerated by the raw power of the Black Dragonflight%.\n\nDeals Shadowflame damage and increases Fire damage taken%.%s*$","被黑龙军团纯粹的力量所焚烧。\n\n造成暗影烈焰伤害，并使受到的火焰伤害提高。"}
