T[8236]={"^Taking (.-)%% maximum health damage as Nature damage every (.-) second%.\nCasting time increased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","每 {{2}} 秒受到最大生命值 {{1}}% 的自然伤害。\n施法时间延长 {{3}}%。"}
