T[8242]={"^Blinded%.\n\nChance to hit reduced by (.-)%%%.\nChance to dodge reduced by (.-)%%%.\nChance to parry reduced by (.-)%%%.%s*$","致盲。\n\n命中几率降低 {{1}}%。\n躲闪几率降低 {{1}}%。\n招架几率降低 {{1}}%。"}
