T[8244]={"^Increases damage dealt and reduces damage taken by (.-)%%%.\n\nStacks up to 9 times%.\n\nBlessing of the tides will always target the lowest health Fathom%-Guard within 30 yards%. If no Fathom%-Guard is within range, Fathom%-Lord Karathress blesses himself%.%s*$","使造成的伤害提高，受到的伤害降低 {{1}}%。\n\n最多可叠加 9 次。\n\n潮汐祝福将始终以 30 码内生命值最低的深渊守卫为目标。如果范围内没有深渊守卫，深渊领主卡拉瑟雷斯将祝福自己。"}
