T[8297]={"^Disguised as a lieutenant of the Scarlet Crusade%.\n\nThis alchemical transformation is not perfect, so you might still want to be careful%.%s*$","伪装成血色十字军的中尉。\n\n这种炼金变形并不完美，所以你或许仍需小心。"}
