T[8305]={"^Greatly empowered by Shirvallah\n\nAll damage dealt increased by (.-)%%%.\nRegenerating (.-)%% Health every second%.%s*$","受到席尔瓦拉的强力加持\n\n造成的所有伤害提高 {{1}}%。\n每秒恢复 {{2}}% 的生命值。"}
