T[8482]={"^Your next Wrath is reduced by (.-)%%, its damage and critical strike chance is increased by (.-)%% and will restores 25%% of base mana%. If cast at 3 stacks, Wrath will also refresh Insect Swarm and reset the cooldown of Chimera Shot%.%s*$","你的下一次愤怒的消耗降低 {{1}}%，其伤害和爆击几率提高 {{2}}%，并将恢复 25% 的基础法力。如果在 3 层时施放，愤怒还会刷新虫群并重置奇美拉射击的冷却时间。"}
T[8483]={"^Casting damaging spells will increase the chance to proc Fingers of Frost by 2%% until it triggers%.\n\nWhen Fingers of Frost triggers you gain Master of Ice, increasing all Frost damage dealt by 6%% for 1%.5 seconds%.%s*$","施放伤害性法术会使寒冰指触发几率提高 2%，直到其触发为止。\n\n当寒冰指触发时，你获得冰霜大师，使造成的所有冰霜伤害提高 6%，持续 1.5 秒。"}
