T[8496]={"^Healing an ally with any direct or periodic Nature heal increases the healing of your next Swiftmend by 3%%%. When fully stacked, your next Swiftmend does not consume a charge, Rejuvenation or Regrowth when used%.%s*$","用任何直接或周期性自然治疗治疗一名盟友，会使你下一次迅捷治愈的治疗量提高 3\\'%。当完全叠加时，你的下一次迅捷治愈不消耗充能，也不消耗回春术或愈合。"}
