T[8500]={"^Healing with Holy Spells reduce the cooldown of Nature's Swiftness by 3 seconds and grants you Harmonized Zeal, upon reaching 3 stacks, your next Divine Favor will also increase your spell haste by 5%% for 12 seconds%.\n\nHealing with Nature Spells reduce the cooldown of Divine Favor by 3 seconds and grant you Natural Zeal, upon reaching 3 stacks of Natural Zeal, your next Nature's Swiftness will increase spell your critical strike chance by 5%% for 12 seconds%.%s*$","用神圣法术治疗会使自然迅捷的冷却时间缩短 3 秒，并为你提供「和谐狂热」，达到 3 层时，你的下一次神恩术还会使你的法术急速提高 5%，持续 12 秒。\n\n用自然法术治疗会使神恩术的冷却时间缩短 3 秒，并为你提供「自然狂热」，达到 3 层自然狂热时，你的下一次自然迅捷将使你的法术爆击几率提高 5%，持续 12 秒。"}
