T[10546]={"^Nature Damage Done increased by (.-)%%%. Some of your Spider Form abilities have a (.-) sec Cast Time, but gain (.-)%% yd increased Range and can be used while moving%. In addition, dealing direct Nature Damage has a chance to cast a free Miasma on the target, Slowing them and creating a cloud of toxic venom that deals damage over time to enemies within%.\n\nAffected abilities: Spider Form Bite, Fang of Shadra, Nerubian Poison, Widowmaker, Rotfang, Corroding Blight and Facemelter%.%s*$","造成的自然伤害提高 {{1}}%。你的一些蜘蛛形态技能有 {{2}} 秒的施法时间，但获得 {{3}}% 的额外射程，并可在移动中使用。此外，造成直接自然伤害时有几率对目标免费施放瘴气，使其减速并制造一片剧毒之云，对身处其中的敌人造成持续伤害。\n\n受影响的技能：蜘蛛形态撕咬、沙德拉之牙、蛛魔毒药、寡妇女王、腐烂之牙、腐蚀枯萎和熔面者。"}
