T[10598]={"^You are in The Saronite Cavern scenario!This is a level 80 heroic PvE challenge that can award Runes of Conquest and additional Azerite%.|cFFFFFFFFSomething is wrong in The Sunken Temple! Dark forces from far away have come and occupied this ancient and sacred place in pursuit of the rich quantities of Saronite that have inexplicably resurfaced with the collapse of the subterranean temple city%. Find the source of this evil and take it out%.%s*$","你正处于萨隆矿洞场景中！这是一个 80 级英雄 PvE 挑战，可获得征服符文和额外的艾泽里特。|cFFFFFFFF沉没的神庙出了些问题！来自远方的黑暗力量已经到来并占据了这处古老而神圣的地方，追寻着随着地下神庙城市坍塌而莫名重新涌出的丰富萨隆邪铁矿。找出这邪恶的源头并消灭它。"}
