T[11148]={"^Increases your Maximum Mana by (.-)%%%.\n\nEvery (.-) sec, you gain a stack of Archmage, increasing your Spell Haste by (.-)%%, stacks up to 15 times%. These stacks are lost on death%.\n\nThis is a Weapon Item, and cannot be used alongside other Weapon Items%.%s*$","使你的最大法力值提高 {{1}}%。\n\n每 {{2}} 秒，你获得一层大法师，使你的法术急速提高 {{3}}%，最多 15 层。这些层数会在死亡时失去。\n\n这是一件武器物品，无法与其他武器物品同时使用。"}
