T[11152]={"^Increases your total Magic Damage done by (.-)%%%.\n\nThis is a Head Item, and cannot be used alongside other Head Items%.%s*$","使你的总魔法伤害提高 {{1}}%。\n\n这是一件头部物品，无法与其他头部物品同时使用。"}
T[11153]={"^Increases your Magic Resistance by (.-)%%%. Every (.-) sec, you gain a shield that reduces the damage you take from the next 3 Magical Attacks by (.-)%%%. While this shield holds, all damage you deal is increased by (.-)%%%.\n\nThis is a Head Item, and cannot be used alongside other Head Items%.%s*$","使你的魔法抗性提高 {{1}}%。每 {{2}} 秒，你获得一个护盾，使你受到接下来 3 次魔法攻击的伤害降低 {{3}}%。护盾存在期间，你造成的所有伤害提高 {{4}}%。\n\n这是一件头部物品，无法与其他头部物品同时使用。"}
T[11154]={"^The next 3 Magical Attacks against you deal (.-)%% reduced damage%.\n\nAll damage done increased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","接下来 3 次针对你的魔法攻击造成的伤害降低 {{1}}%。\n\n造成的所有伤害提高 {{2}}%。"}
