T[11156]={"^Increases your Critical Strike Chance by (.-)%%%.\n\nDealing damage to an enemy player Marks them for (.-), increasing all damage they take by (.-)%%%. This effect cannot occur more than once every minute%.\n\nThis is a Head Item, and cannot be used alongside other Head Items%.%s*$","使你的爆击几率提高 {{1}}%。\n\n对敌方玩家造成伤害时，将其标记 {{2}}，使其受到的所有伤害提高 {{3}}%。此效果每分钟最多触发一次。\n\n这是一件头部物品，无法与其他头部物品同时使用。"}
T[11157]={"^Increases all Shadow Damage dealt by (.-)%%%. While at 20 stacks, your Shadow Damage effects always critically strike%.\n\nStacks up to 20 times%.%s*$","使你的暗影伤害提高 {{1}}%。当你达到 20 层时，你的暗影伤害效果始终造成爆击。\n\n最多叠加 20 次。"}
T[11158]={"^Your Shadow Damage effects always critically strike%.%s*$","你的暗影伤害效果始终造成爆击。"}
T[11159]={"^Increases all Healing you do by (.-)%%, and your Armor by (.-)%%%. Makes you Immune to Power Burn effects%.\n\nThis is a Head Item, and cannot be used alongside other Head Items%.%s*$","使你造成的所有治疗效果提高 {{1}}%，护甲提高 {{2}}%。使你免疫能量燃烧效果。\n\n这是一件头部物品，无法与其他头部物品同时使用。"}
T[11160]={"^Dealing Magic Damage to an enemy increases all Periodic Damage they take by (.-)%%, and burns them for (.-)%% of their Maximum Health over (.-)%.\n\nIncreases your Magic Resistance by (.-)%%%.\n\nThis is a Weapon Item, and cannot be used alongside other Weapon Items%.%s*$","对敌人造成魔法伤害会使其受到的周期性伤害提高 {{1}}%，并在 {{3}} 内灼烧其最大生命值的 {{2}}%。\n\n使你的魔法抗性提高 {{4}}%。\n\n这是一件武器物品，无法与其他武器物品同时使用。"}
T[11161]={"^Periodic Damage Taken increased by (.-)%%%. Taking (.-)%% of your Maximum Health as Physical Damage every (.-) sec%.%s*$","受到的周期性伤害提高 {{1}}%。每 {{3}} 秒受到相当于最大生命值 {{2}}% 的物理伤害。"}
