T[11165]={"^You are using your Sniper Rifle%.\n\nYour Scrap Shots will have a (.-)%% reduced Firing Rate, but will ignore (.-)%% of your target's Armor, and have (.-)%% increased Critical Strike Damage%. If you are at least 10 yards away from your target, your Scrap Shots will also increase your Critical Strike Rating by (.-)%% of your Intellect for (.-)%.%s*$","你正在使用狙击步枪。\n\n你的废料射击的射击速率降低 {{1}}%，但会无视目标 {{2}}% 的护甲，且爆击伤害提高 {{3}}%。如果你与目标相距至少 10 码，你的废料射击还会使你的爆击等级提高相当于你智力的 {{4}}%，持续 {{5}}。"}
T[11166]={"^Your next Primordial Blast is instant cast%.%s*$","你的下一次原始冲击为瞬发。"}
