T[11174]={"^You can use a Combat Move to end the chain!\n\nAfter completing the Oath Chain you also gain (.-)%% increased Movement Speed for (.-), stacks up to 3 times%.%s*$","你可以使用一个战斗招式来结束连击！\n\n完成誓约锁链后，你还会获得 {{1}}% 的移动速度提高，持续 {{2}}，最多叠加 3 次。"}
