T[11182]={"^Healing done reduced by (.-)%%%. Damage taken reduced by (.-)%%%.\n\nYou have a chance to Curse enemies with Touch of Mueh'zala whenever you deal damage to them, reducing their Attack Power, Spell Damage and Haste Rating based on your Spell Power%.%s*$","造成的治疗效果降低 {{1}}%。受到的伤害降低 {{2}}%。\n\n每当你对敌人造成伤害时，都有几率用穆厄扎拉之触诅咒他们，根据你的法术强度降低其攻击强度、法术伤害和急速等级。"}
T[11183]={"^Your next Glacial Dagger has no cost, deals (.-)%% increased damage%.%s*$","你的下一次冰川匕首不消耗资源，且造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%。"}
