T[11186]={"^Cannot use Movement abilities such as Leaps, Charges, Dashses, Teleports, Blinks etc%. This does not include Movement Speed increases%.%s*$","无法使用跳跃、冲锋、冲刺、传送、闪现等移动技能。这不包括移动速度的提高。"}
