T[11188]={"^Next |cffffffffRight Hook|r deals (.-)%% increased damage and generates a Holy Rune%.%s*$","下一次 |cffffffff右勾拳|r 造成的伤害提高 {{1}}% 并生成一枚神圣符文。"}
