T[11205]={"^Causes you to call down an Astral Flare on enemies whenever you dodge, block or parry one of their attacks%. In addition, all damage you take is reduced by (.-)%%, and all Threat generated by Physical and Arcane damage is increased by (.-)%%%.\n\nOnly 1 Aspect can be active at a time%.%s*$","使你在躲闪、格挡或招架敌人攻击时召唤一道星界耀斑落在敌人身上。此外，你受到的所有伤害降低 {{1}}%，物理和奥术伤害产生的所有威胁值提高 {{2}}%。\n\n同一时间只能激活 1 个守护形态。"}
T[11206]={"^Your next ability that spends 100%% of your Mana is empowered%.\n\nMoonblade: Deals (.-)%% increased damage and increases your Energy Regeneration by (.-)%% for (.-)%.\n\nStarfire Shot: Has (.-)%% increased Critical Strike Chance and grants you (.-)%% increased Ranged Haste for (.-)%.\n\nStarsweep: Deals (.-)%% increased damage%.\n\nLunar Renewal: Affects up to (.-) additional nearby targets%.\n\nMoon Guard: Reduces all damage you take by (.-)%% until Moon Guard ends%.%s*$","你的下一个消耗 100% 法力值的技能已被强化。\n\n月刃：造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%，并使你的能量回复提高 {{2}}%，持续 {{3}}。\n\n星火射击：爆击几率提高 {{4}}%，并赋予你远程急速提高 {{5}}%，持续 {{6}}。\n\n星弧扫击：造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%。\n\n月华焕新：影响最多 {{8}} 个额外的附近目标。\n\n月之守卫：使你受到的所有伤害降低 {{9}}%，直到月之守卫结束。"}
T[11207]={"^Damage taken from Scattered Stars increased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","受到散落星辰的伤害提高 {{1}}%。"}
T[11208]={"^Whenever you are healed, you have a 25%% chance to enable your Vengeance of Elune ability for (.-)%.%s*$","每当你受到治疗时，都有 25% 的几率使你的艾露恩的复仇技能可用，持续 {{1}}。"}
T[11209]={"^Trapped in Webbing! You are unable to move or act, and take (.-)%% increased damage%. Being Healed reduces the remaining duration of this effect%.%s*$","被困于蛛网！你无法移动或行动，且受到的伤害提高 {{1}}%。受到治疗会缩短此效果的剩余持续时间。"}
T[11210]={"^Absorbs damage%. Next |cffffffffHorrorbolt|r or |cffffffffAbyssal Reconstruction|r will consume this effect to do (.-)%% increased damage or healing%.%s*$","吸收伤害。下一次 |cffffffff恐惧之箭|r 或 |cffffffff深渊重构|r 会消耗此效果，造成 {{1}}% 的额外伤害或治疗。"}
T[11211]={"^Increases the damage your Curse of Blood deals when it explodes by (.-)%%, but it no longer generates Rage%.\n\nIn addition, if the target is affected by Shadow Hemorrhage when the explosion occurs, it spreads to nearby enemies around the target%.%s*$","使你鲜血诅咒爆炸时造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%，但不再产生怒气。\n\n此外，如果爆炸发生时目标受到暗影出血影响，则会扩散到目标周围的附近敌人。"}
