T[11846]={"^With scales as dark as the night, this python considers himself a master of stealth, silently appearing at your side and delighting in any startled reactions%. He’s convinced he’s as shadowy as a wraith, though he might be a bit too cute to truly intimidate%.%s*$","这条鳞片暗如黑夜的蟒蛇自认是潜行大师，总是悄无声息地出现在你身边，并乐见任何受到惊吓的反应。它坚信自己像幽灵一样阴森，不过或许它有点太可爱了，实在吓不到人。"}
T[11847]={"^This warm%-toned python has a dignified air, watching over your adventures with an unhurried, regal calm%. When he’s not draped on your shoulder like a royal mantle, he’s likely napping, dreaming of sunnier days and cozy places to curl up%.%s*$","这条色调温暖的蟒蛇气度威严，以从容的王者之姿守护着你的冒险。当它不像御袍一样搭在你肩上时，多半正在打盹，梦见更晴朗的日子和舒适的蜷缩之处。"}
T[11848]={"^This little green python sees himself as the ultimate forest predator, blending effortlessly into the canopy %(or so he thinks%)%. Whether he's posing dramatically on your shoulder or peeking out from under your collar, he's got his “jungle guardian” act down—mostly%.%s*$","这条小绿蟒自认是终极的森林掠食者，能毫不费力地融入树冠（至少它自己是这么想的）。无论是在你肩上摆出夸张的姿势，还是从你衣领下探出头来，它都十分认真地扮演着\"丛林守护者\"的角色——大部分时候吧。"}
