T[12194]={"^Increases the damage of your active Immolate and Flame Shock and Lava Burst by (.-)%%%. Casting Elemental Immolation or Conflagrate resets your stacks of Elemental Destruction%. This effect can not be refreshed at max stacks%.%s*$","使你的激活献祭和烈焰震击以及你的熔岩爆发的伤害提高{{1}}%。施放元素献祭或燃烧会重置你的元素毁灭层数。达到最大层数时无法刷新此效果。"}
