T[12196]={"^Bleeding for (.-) Frost damage plus a percentage of weapon damage every (.-) seconds%.\nIncreases the Frost damage taken from the caster by (.-)%%%. Additionally, increases damage taken from your Fireball and Lighthing Bolt by (.-)%%%.%s*$","每{{2}}秒因流血受到{{1}}点冰霜伤害外加一定百分比的武器伤害。\n使从施法者处受到的冰霜伤害提高{{3}}%。此外，使你从火球术和闪电箭受到的伤害提高{{4}}%。"}
