T[12198]={"^Bleeding for (.-) Nature damage plus a percentage of weapon damage every (.-) seconds%.\nIncreases the Nature damage taken from the caster by (.-)%%%. Additionally, increases damage taken from your Fireball and Frost Bolt by (.-)%%%.%s*$","每{{2}}秒因流血受到{{1}}点自然伤害外加一定百分比的武器伤害。\n使从施法者处受到的自然伤害提高{{3}}%。此外，使你的火球术和冰霜箭造成的伤害提高{{4}}%。"}
T[12199]={"^Replaces your Lesser Healing Wave with Tidal Shield%.%s*$","将你的次级治疗波替换为潮汐之盾。"}
