T[12223]={"^Increases damage dealt by (.-)%% %((.-)%% against players%) and reduces damage taken from creatures by (.-)%%%. Special attacks restore (.-) energy to the pet's owner%.%s*$","使造成的伤害提高{{1}}%（对玩家为{{2}}%），并使从生物受到的伤害降低{{3}}%。特殊攻击为宠物的主人恢复{{4}}点能量。"}
T[12224]={"^Next Energy ability deals (.-)%% increased direct damage and costs (.-) less energy%.%s*$","下一个能量技能的直接伤害提高{{1}}%，且消耗的能量减少{{2}}。"}
