T[12237]={"^Transforms your Arcane Explosion into Starburst%.\n\nThis channeled ability creates 3 Arcane explosions around your target over 6 seconds%. Starfire reduces the channel time by 1%.5 seconds per stack and increases the damage done by 10%%%. This effect stacks up to 3 times%.\n\nDoes not work with War Mage or Lunar Spirits%.%s*$","将你的奥术爆炸转变为星爆。\n\n此引导技能会在6秒内围绕你的目标制造3次奥术爆炸。星火术每层使引导时间缩短1.5秒，并使造成的伤害提高10%。此效果最多可叠加3次。\n\n无法与战斗法师或月之精灵一同使用。"}
T[12238]={"^Deals Frost damage on Direct Damaging Melee Rogue abilities%.%s*$","在潜行者的直接伤害近战技能上造成冰霜伤害。"}
T[12239]={"^Poison Bomb cdr%s*$","毒药炸弹冷却缩减"}
T[12240]={"^Deadly Poison applied every (.-) seconds%.%s*$","每{{1}}秒施加一次致命毒药。"}
T[12241]={"^Using Colossus Smash allows your Seal Fate to trigger from any non%-rogue based single%-target melee ability for 12 seconds%. In addition, your Rogue finishers has a 20%% chance per combo point to reduce the remaining cooldown of your Colossus Smash by 5 seconds%.%s*$","使用巨人打击后，你的命运封印可在12秒内由任何非潜行者基础的单体近战技能触发。此外，你的潜行者终结技每个连击点有20%的几率使你巨人打击的剩余冷却时间缩短5秒。"}
T[12242]={"^You take (.-)%% more damage from Seal procs%.%s*$","你从圣印触发效果中受到的伤害提高{{1}}%。"}
T[12243]={"^Movement speed reduced by (.-)%%%.%s*$","移动速度降低{{1}}%。"}
T[12244]={"^You can cast Heavenly Blade again%.%s*$","你可以再次施放天堂之刃。"}
T[12245]={"^Empowers your next Shield Slam or Shield of Righteousness%.%s*$","强化你下一个盾牌猛击或正义盾击。"}
T[12246]={"^Your next Aimed Shot, Barbed Shot, Compound Shot or Arcane Shot deals 25%% increased damage versus monsters and will ricochet, hitting up to 5 targets, losing extra momentum with every target hit%.%s*$","你下一个瞄准射击、倒刺射击、复合射击或奥术射击对怪物造成的伤害提高25%，并将弹射命中最多5个目标，每命中一个目标都会损失额外的动能。"}
T[12247]={"^Lowers the global cooldown of your next Cat Form shapeshift%.%s*$","使你下一次猎豹形态变形的公共冷却时间缩短。"}
