T[12249]={"^Applies Beacon of Virtue to your target and 4 injured allies within (.-) yds for (.-)%.\n\nWhile active, your Holy heals with a cast time will also heal the Beacons of Virtue for 25%% of the original amount%.%s*$","对你的目标及{{1}}码内4名受伤的盟友施加美德道标，持续{{2}}。\n\n激活期间，你的带施法时间的神圣治疗也会为美德道标恢复相当于原治疗量25%的生命值。"}
T[12250]={"^Beacon of Virtue%.%s*$","美德道标。"}
T[12251]={"^Holy Light can now benefit from the Ancestral Healing, Improved Healing Wave and Ancestral Awakening talents%.%s*$","圣光现在可以受益于先祖治疗、强化治疗波和先祖觉醒天赋。"}
T[12252]={"^Healing Wave can now benefit from the Sanctified Light, Healing Light and Divine Aegis talents%.%s*$","治疗波现在可以受益于圣化之光、治疗之光和神圣庇护天赋。"}
