T[12265]={"^Pacifies and silences fleeing unit%.%s*$","安抚并沉默逃跑的单位。"}
T[12266]={"^Sets your Experience back to 1x Rates%s*$","将你的经验倍率设回 1x"}
T[12267]={"^Everything is strange%. You feel happy hungry and relaxed%. It's like you are discovering everything for the first time again%. You appreciate things you never noticed before, but can't tell genius from idiocy%. \n\nMoving will bring you back to reality%.%s*$","一切都如此陌生。你感到快乐、饥饿又放松。就好像你第一次重新发现一切。你欣赏从前未曾留意的事物，却分不清天才与蠢货。\n\n移动会让你回到现实。"}
T[12268]={"^Immune to Polymorph effects%.  Increases swim speed by (.-)%% and allows underwater breathing%. You are Nessy%.%s*$","免疫变形效果。游泳速度提高 {{1}}%，并可以在水下呼吸。你就是尼斯。"}
T[12269]={"^Increases Shadow damage done by (.-)%% and Shadow spell critical strike chance by (.-)%%%.%s*$","使你造成的暗影伤害提高 {{1}}%，暗影法术的爆击几率提高 {{2}}%。"}
T[12270]={"^\nTeaches you Metamorphosis %(Dark Apotheosis%) and Taunt %(Dark Apotheosis%)%. \n\nYour Metamorphosis ability is transformed into Demon Spikes if you know Metamorphosis%.\n\nThe damage done by you and your pets is reduced by 40%%, and reduces the cooldown of your Immolation aura by 20 seconds%. \n\nWhile dual wielding you gain Dark Apotheosis%.\n\nShadow Cleave now costs 20 rage, and can only hit one target%. After dealing damage with Shadow Cleave your next damaging spell with a cast time will heal your summoned demon and restore 1%% of their maximum mana, and extend your Immolation Aura by 3 seconds%. This effect can only occur once every second%.%s*$","\n教你变形术（黑暗神化）和嘲讽（黑暗神化）。\n\n如果你已学会变形术，你的变形术技能会变为恶魔尖刺。\n\n你和你宠物造成的伤害降低 40%，并使你的献祭光环的冷却时间缩短 20 秒。\n\n当你双持武器战斗时，你获得黑暗神化。\n\n暗影顺劈现在消耗 20 点怒气，且只能击中一个目标。用暗影顺劈造成伤害后，你下一个有施法时间的伤害性法术会治疗你召唤的恶魔并为其恢复 1% 的最大法力值，同时使你的献祭光环延长 3 秒。此效果每 1 秒只能触发一次。"}
T[12271]={"^Your Shadow Cleave hits reduce the duration of your next Drain Soul by 20%%, stacks up to 4 times%. This can only occur once every 4 seconds%.%s*$","你的暗影顺劈命中会使你下一个吸取灵魂的持续时间缩短 20%，最多叠加 4 次。此效果每 4 秒只能触发一次。"}
T[12272]={"^Your Incinerate hits have a 20%% chance to cause your next Chaos Bolt to trigger no cooldown%. This can stack up to two times%. \nThis effect does not stack with the Emberstorm Capstone%.%s*$","你的灼烧命中后有 20% 的几率使你下一个混乱之箭不触发冷却时间。此效果最多叠加两次。\n此效果不与「余烬风暴」基石叠加。"}
T[12273]={"^Dealing frost damage gives you a Polar charge stacks up to 10 times%. Your Holy damage spells have a 3%% per polar charge chance to grant you Polar Light for 10 seconds consuming the charges and increasing your Frost critical strike chance and reducing the mana cost of your frost spells by 50%%%.%s*$","造成冰霜伤害会赋予你一层极地充能，最多叠加 10 次。你的神圣伤害法术每层极地充能有 3% 的几率赋予你极地之光，持续 10 秒，消耗所有层数，并使你的冰霜爆击几率提高，同时使你的冰霜法术法力消耗降低 50%。"}
T[12274]={"^Increases your chance to trigger Polar Charge by (.-)%%%.%s*$","使你触发极地充能的几率提高 {{1}}%。"}
T[12275]={"^Increasing your Frost critical strike chance and reduces the mana cost of your frost spells by 50%%%.%s*$","提高你的冰霜爆击几率，并使你的冰霜法术法力消耗降低 50%。"}
T[12276]={"^You are the Infernal Warbringer!%s*$","你就是地狱战争使者！"}
T[12277]={"^Releases lethal poison into your target, dealing %(162%%%) Weapon damage instantly and an additional %(30%.00%% of Attack power%) Nature damage over 15 sec and increases the damage your target takes from your Insect Swarm by 5%%%. \n\nEach time you deal nature damage to a target affected by Lifebane, your target gains an additional stack of Lifebane%.%s*$","向你的目标释放致命毒药，立即造成 (162%) 武器伤害，并在 15 秒内额外造成 (30.00% 攻击强度) 点自然伤害，同时使你的目标受到「困虫」的伤害提高 5%。\n\n每当你对受到「生命之缚」影响的目标造成自然伤害时，你的目标会额外获得一层「生命之缚」。"}
T[12278]={"^Taking nature damage every second%.\nIncreases damage taken from your Insect Swarm by (.-)%%%.%s*$","每秒受到自然伤害。\n你受到虫群的伤害提高 {{1}}%。"}
T[12279]={"^(.-) damage every second%.%s*$","每秒 {{1}} 点伤害。"}
T[12280]={"^Your next Ghostly Strike triggers no cooldown and returns 50 rage%.%s*$","你接下来的幽灵打击不触发冷却时间，并返还 50 点怒气。"}
T[12281]={"^Block rating increased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","格挡等级提高 {{1}}%。"}
T[12282]={"^Your Chaos Bolt deals (.-)%% more damage against monsters, triggers |cFFFFFFFFChaos Keeper|r and has no cooldown%.%s*$","你的混乱之箭对怪物造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%，触发 |cFFFFFFFF混乱守护者|r，且没有冷却时间。"}
T[12283]={"^You learn the Channel Spellfire ability%. \n\nYour Searing Pain criticals reduce the periodic interval of your next Channel Spellfire by 10%%%. This effect stacks up to 8 times%.%s*$","你学会引导法术火焰。\n\n你的灼热之痛爆击使你下一个引导法术火焰的周期间隔缩短 10%。此效果最多叠加 8 次。"}
T[12284]={"^Your next Soul Fire deals (.-)%% %((.-)%% vs players%) more damage and has (.-)%% shorter cast time%.%s*$","你接下来的灵魂之火造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%（对玩家为 {{2}}%），施法时间缩短 {{3}}%。"}
T[12285]={"^Your Dispatch & Counterattack increases the damage of your next Colossus Smash by 30%% per stack and extends its duration by 2 seconds%.%s*$","你的「击溃与反击」使你的下一个巨人打击每层伤害提高 30%，并使其持续时间延长 2 秒。"}
T[12286]={"^Increases the damage dealt to the target from your Arcane Missiles by (.-)%%%.%s*$","使你对你目标造成的奥术飞弹伤害提高 {{1}}%。"}
T[12287]={"^Counterattack > Armorsmasher SLS%s*$","破甲者 > 反击 SLS"}
T[12288]={"^Your Mongoose Bite increases the damage of your next Execute by (.-)%% and increases the chance to trigger Sudden Death by  (.-)%%%.\n\nYour Execute criticals also resets the cooldown of your Raptor Strike%.%s*$","你的猫鼬撕咬使你下一个斩杀造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%，并使触发猝死的几率提高 {{2}}%。\n\n你的斩杀爆击还会重置你的猛禽一击的冷却时间。"}
T[12289]={"^pve one is done differently to pvp one since there is some problem with negative sls and other peoples auras%s*$","PvE 的做法与 PvP 不同，因为负值 SLS 和其他人的光环存在一些问题"}
T[12290]={"^Bleeding for (.-) Physical Damage every (.-) sec%.%s*$","每 {{2}} 秒因流血受到 {{1}} 点物理伤害。"}
T[12291]={"^Skewered by a Javelin, taking (.-)%% additional damage from from the caster's Colossus Smash%.%s*$","被标枪刺穿，受到施法者的巨人打击的额外 {{1}}% 伤害。"}
T[12292]={"^Skewered by a Javelin, taking (.-)%% additional damage from Impaled and (.-)%% from the caster's Colossus Smash%.%s*$","被标枪刺穿，受到穿刺的额外 {{1}}% 伤害，以及施法者的毁灭巨人的额外 {{2}}% 伤害。"}
