T[12308]={"^After (.-), this explodes%. Casters healing applied to the bomb stores triple the amount, converting it into explosive damage upon detonation%.%s*$","{{1}} 后，它会爆炸。施法者对炸弹施加的治疗会储存三倍数值，在引爆时转化为爆炸伤害。"}
T[12309]={"^Plant a Flourishing Bomb at a target location%. After (.-), it explodes%. Healing applied to the bomb stores triple the amount, converting it into explosive damage upon detonation%.%s*$","在目标位置放置一个繁盛炸弹。{{1}} 后，它会爆炸。对炸弹施加的治疗会储存三倍数值，在引爆时转化为爆炸伤害。"}
T[12310]={"^A cloud of disease surrounds the bearer, causing Plague damage to nearby enemies%.%s*$","一团疾病之云环绕着携带者，对附近敌人造成瘟疫伤害。"}
T[12311]={"^If you Interrupt your target with Shield Bash it causes the target to burst into flames, dealing x fire damage, and increasing their damage taken by your fire spells by %%%.%s*$","如果你用盾牌猛击打断你的目标，目标会爆燃，造成 x 点火焰伤害，并使其受到你的火焰法术的伤害提高 %。"}
