T[12315]={"^Backstab and Mutilate deal additional Fire damage%.%s*$","背刺和毁伤造成额外的火焰伤害。"}
T[12316]={"^Your shield bash causes the target to begin to freeze, slowing them for X%%%.\nIf you successfully interrupt a target with Shield Bash you apply Deep Freeze to the target%.%s*$","你的盾牌猛击使目标开始冻结，使其减速 X%。\n如果你用盾牌猛击成功打断目标，则对目标施加深度冻结。"}
T[12317]={"^Increases the caster's Warlock Shadow damage%-over%-time effects and Shadow, and Physical damage from melee abilities by (.-)%%%.%s*$","使施法者的术士暗影持续伤害效果提高 {{1}}%，并使近战技能造成的暗影伤害和物理伤害提高相同数值。"}
