T[12342]={"^Teaches you Ghostly Blow if you know Riposte%. Ghostly Blow deals Shadow damage to the target and additional damage every 3 seconds over 5 seconds%. %(intended to tick only once%)%. When Ghostly blow deals periodic damage to a target within 8 yards of you, you will throw a ghostly blade at them, dealing damage and refreshing the duration of Ghostly Blow%.%s*$","如果你已学会还击，则教你幽灵打击。幽灵打击对目标造成暗影伤害，并在 5 秒内每 3 秒造成一次额外伤害。（预计只会触发一次）。当幽灵打击对你 8 码内的目标造成周期性伤害时，你会向它掷出一把幽灵之刃，造成伤害并刷新幽灵打击的持续时间。"}
