T[12373]={"^Increases the damage of your Rip and Rake by 15%% and your Claw ability now costs 10 less energy and gains additional damage equal to 25%% of your attack power%. In addition, your Claw and Bloodthirst extends the duration of your Rake by 6 seconds and Rip by 2 seconds%. Using Claw also sharpens your claws, increasing your physical damage by 2%% and the damage of your Bloodthirst by 8%%%. This effect stacks up to 3 times%. Casting Bloodthirst while in Cat Form now also grants a combo point on the target%. %(Damage of claw is reduced by 15%% against players%)%.%s*$","使你的割裂和斜掠的伤害提高 15%，你的爪击技能现在消耗的能量减少 10 点，并获得相当于你攻击强度 25% 的额外伤害。此外，你的爪击和热血的持续时间会延长你的割裂 6 秒、斜掠 2 秒。使用爪击还会磨利你的利爪，使你的物理伤害提高 2%，热血伤害提高 8%。此效果最多叠加 3 次。在猎豹形态下施放热血现在还会为你对目标增加一个连击点数。（爪击对玩家的伤害降低 15%）。"}
