T[12595]={"^Your melee combo point Rogue generators and finishing moves deal bonus frost damage for 30 seconds after using Cold Blood%. However, the critical strike chance granted from Cold Blooded is reduced by 1%% but the duration of this effect is doubled%. \n\nAdditionally, dealing direct Frost Damage reduces the cooldown of Cold Blood by 10 seconds%.%s*$","使用冷血后的 30 秒内，你的近战连击点数生成技能和潜行者终结技会造成额外的冰霜伤害。但冷血赋予的爆击几率降低 1%，而此效果的持续时间翻倍。\n\n此外，造成直接冰霜伤害会使冷血的冷却时间缩短 10 秒。"}
T[12596]={"^You feel sheltered%.%.%.%s*$","你感到自己很安全……"}
T[12597]={"^Target's soul has withered away causing caster's Drain Life to transfers 25%% more health from the target%.%s*$","目标的灵魂已经枯萎，使施法者的吸取生命从目标身上吸取的生命值提高 25%。"}
T[12598]={"^Increasing the direct damage dealt with Fire spells by the caster to the target by (.-)%%%.%s*$","使施法者用火焰法术对目标造成的直接伤害提高 {{1}}%。"}
T[12599]={"^Rooted%. Spinning in place, dealing (.-) damage to enemies within 8 yards every second%.%s*$","被定身。原地旋转，每秒对 8 码内的敌人造成 {{1}} 点伤害。"}
