T[12602]={"^Draining the target's will to live%. Reaching 10 stacks causes your next Pyroblast or Fire Blast to deal 20%% more damage and giving the target a Withered Soul%.%s*$","吸取目标求生的意志。达到 10 层时，你接下来的炎爆术或火焰冲击会造成 20% 的额外伤害，并使目标获得一个枯萎之魂。"}
