T[12683]={"^Holy Fire heals nearby allies, hits (.-) additional enemies and increases the duration by 2 seconds\n\nFlamestrike has a reduced cast time of (.-)%% and increases the duration by 2 seconds%.\n\nCircle of Healing heals for (.-)%% more and triggers Ring of Fire, dealing radiant damage to up to 3 enemies near your healed allies%.%s*$","神圣之火治疗附近盟友，额外击中 {{1}} 个敌人，并使持续时间延长 2 秒\n\n烈焰风暴的施法时间缩短 {{2}}%，持续时间延长 2 秒。\n\n治疗之环的治疗量提高 {{3}}%，并激活火焰之环，对被治疗的盟友附近最多 3 个敌人造成光辉伤害。"}
