T[12696]={"^Your direct heals grant you Restoring Tides%. Mana Tide Totem now also heals for 200%% of Healing Stream Totem's effect%.\n\nRestoring Tides increase the periodic healing of Healing Stream Totem by %% per stack%.%s*$","你的直接治疗会赋予你恢复之潮。法力之潮图腾现在还会治疗相当于治疗之泉图腾效果 200% 的生命值。\n\n每层恢复之潮会使治疗之泉图腾的周期性治疗提高 %。"}
T[12697]={"^Earth Shock increases your Reckoning proc chance by 15%% for 8 seconds%. Dealing damage with Reckoning will allow your Earth Shock to hit up to 3 enemies%.%s*$","大地震击使你的「清算」触发几率提高 15%，持续 8 秒。用清算造成伤害将使你的大地震击最多击中 3 个敌人。"}
T[12698]={"^Earth Shock can now jump to 3 targets%s*$","大地震击现在可以跳跃至 3 个目标"}
T[12699]={"^Your next Doomglaive will trigger a Felstrike%.%s*$","你接下来的末日之刃会触发一次邪能打击。"}
