T[12704]={"^Releases a bunch of Shadow Bolts%s*$","释放一连串暗影箭"}
T[12705]={"^Increases your next Shadow damage by (.-)%%%.%s*$","使你接下来的暗影伤害提高 {{1}}%。"}
T[12706]={"^Increases the direct damage of your next Arctis by (.-)%% %((.-)%% versus players%), critical strike chance by (.-)%% and reduces the mana cost by (.-)%%%.\n\nFrostbolt and Ice Lance grant additional stacks of Winter's Mantle%. Upon reaching 4 stacks you gain Heart of Winter%.%s*$","使你接下来的冰霜法术的直接伤害提高 {{1}}%（对玩家为 {{2}}%），爆击几率提高 {{3}}%，法力消耗降低 {{4}}%。\n\n冰川射线和冰枪术会赋予额外的寒冬披风层数。达到 4 层时，你获得凛冬之心。"}
T[12707]={"^Increases the damage of your next Fuego by (.-)%% %((.-)%% versus players%), critical strike chance by (.-)%% and reduces the mana cost by (.-)%%%.\n\nFireball and Fire Blast grant additional stacks of Gathering Will%. Upon reaching 4 stacks your Fuego deals additional damage to nearby enemies%.%s*$","使你接下来的火焰伤害提高 {{1}}%（对玩家为 {{2}}%），爆击几率提高 {{3}}%，法力消耗降低 {{4}}%。\n\n火球术和火焰冲击会赋予额外的「意志汇集」层数。达到 4 层时，你的火焰会对附近敌人造成额外伤害。"}
T[12708]={"^Hunter shots deal additional Shadow damage and grants Shadow Shells%.%s*$","猎人的射击造成额外的暗影伤害，并赋予暗影甲壳。"}
