T[12715]={"^Your next Wild Growth's range is increased by (.-) yards and heals (.-) additional targets%.\n\nHealing Touch and Regrowth consume up to 2 stacks to reduce their cast time by 50%% per stack consumed%.%s*$","你接下来的野性成长的射程延长 {{1}} 码，并额外治疗 {{2}} 个目标。\n\n治疗之触和愈合最多消耗 2 层，每消耗一层使其施法时间缩短 50%。"}
