T[12753]={"^Attacking all nearby enemies for normal damage plus (.-)%.\nImmune to stun%.\nEach note reduces the targets armor%.%s*$","攻击所有附近敌人，造成普通伤害外加 {{1}}。\n免疫昏迷。\n每个音符都会降低目标的护甲。"}
