T[12761]={"^You have become the victim of the Anub'rekhan's Dark Gaze%.\nDamage taken increased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","你成了阿努布雷坎的黑暗凝视的受害者。\n受到的伤害提高 {{1}}%。"}
