T[12782]={"^Rank 7: Blood Guard\n\nHigh%-risk mode enables FFA PvP and causes you and anyone else you kill to drop loot on death%.\n\nYou gain Glory when defeating enemies within 2 ranks of your own in High%-risk, but also lose Glory on death%.%s*$","7 级：血卫士\n\n高风险模式会启用自由 PvP，并使你以及任何被你杀死的其他玩家在死亡时掉落战利品。\n\n在高风险模式中击败等级在你上下 2 级以内的敌人可获得荣耀，但死亡时也会失去荣耀。"}
