T[12820]={"^War Mode is enabled%. This increases your experience in the Open world by 10%%%. Allows you to loot new materials from the open world%.%s*$","战争模式已启用。这会使你在开放世界中的经验值提高 10%。\n允许你从开放世界中获取新的材料。"}
T[12821]={"^Mounts no longer increase movement speed and your movement speed is decreased by (.-)%%%.\n \nYou can not cast Stealth, Prowl, Invisibility and you can not cast Shadowmeld, Hearthstone, teleport or trade with other players while affected by Crow's Spite%.\n\nRemoved when you loot the Crow's Cache in a safe zone%.%s*$","坐骑不再提高移动速度，且你的移动速度降低 {{1}}%。\n \n在受渡鸦之怨影响期间，你无法施放潜行、追踪、隐形，也无法施放暗影融合、炉石、传送，或与其他玩家交易。\n\n在安全区域拾取渡鸦的藏匿处即可移除此效果。"}
T[12822]={"^Marks of Ascension can be earned through completing Call Board Quests and other great deeds%.%s*$","飞升印记可以通过完成告示板任务和其他伟大事迹获得。"}
T[12823]={"^This skill card allows your hero to master the use of Blizzard!%s*$","这张技能卡让你的英雄掌握暴风雪的使用！"}
