T[13007]={"^Your Mongoose Bite, Raptor Strike and Counterattack deals bonus Fire damage%.%s*$","你的猛禽撕咬、猛禽打击与反击造成额外的火焰伤害。"}
T[13008]={"^Your Mongoose Bite, Raptor Strike, Carve and Counterattack deals bonus Fire damage%.%s*$","你的猛禽撕咬、猛禽打击、削凿与反击造成额外的火焰伤害。"}
