T[13012]={"^Increases the damage of your active Immolate by (.-)%% and your Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning by (.-)%%%. Casting Immolate or Conflagrate consumes this buff%.%s*$","使你激活的献祭造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%，你的闪电箭与闪电链造成的伤害提高 {{2}}%。施放献祭或燃烧会消耗此增益效果。"}
T[13013]={"^Increases the damage of your active Immolate and Flame Shock by (.-)%%%. Casting Elemental Immolation or Conflagrate resets your stacks of Elemental Destruction%.%s*$","使你激活的献祭与烈焰震击造成的伤害提高 {{1}}%。施放元素献祭或燃烧会重置你的元素毁灭层数。"}
T[13014]={"^Deals (.-) Physical damage every (.-) second to nearby enemies, increases your attack speed by (.-)%%, and Stormstrike's damage by (.-)%%%.%s*$","每 {{2}} 秒对附近敌人造成 {{1}} 点物理伤害，使你的攻击速度提高 {{3}}%，风暴打击的伤害提高 {{4}}%。"}
T[13015]={"^(.-) Physical damage every (.-) (.-) and increases your attack speed by (.-)%% and |cFFFFFFFFWind Strike|r damage by (.-)%%%.%s*$","每 {{2}} {{3}}造成 {{1}} 点物理伤害，使你的攻击速度提高 {{4}}%，|cFFFFFFFF风怒|r的伤害提高 {{5}}%。"}
