T[13118]={"^Increases your melee attack speed by (.-)%%%. While at max stacks, your next Windfury hits 2 additional times and consumes all stacks%.%s*$","使你的近战攻击速度提高 {{1}}%。当你达到最大层数时，你的下一个风怒攻击会额外攻击 2 次并消耗所有层数。"}
