T[13127]={"^Your next Riptide will apply to (.-) additional nearby allies and last for an extra (.-) seconds%.%s*$","你的下一个节奏潮汐将施加于 {{1}} 个额外的附近盟友，且持续时间延长 {{2}} 秒。"}
T[13128]={"^Dealing damage every second and reduces attack speed of enemies hit by (.-)%%%. Armor increased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","每秒造成伤害，并使受到影响的敌人的攻击速度降低 {{1}}%。护甲提高 {{2}}%。"}
T[13129]={"^Time between attacks increased by by (.-)%%%.%s*$","攻击间隔延长 {{1}}%。"}
