T[13233]={"^Permanently enchant a melee weapon for your spell, ranged and melee attacks to increase your Attack Power by (.-) and your Spell Power by (.-) for (.-)%.  This can not occur more than once every 220%.5 sec%.%s*$","永久：为一把近战武器附魔，使你的法术、远程与近战攻击有几率在 {{3}} 内使你的攻击强度提高 {{1}}、法术强度提高 {{2}}。此效果每 220.5 秒最多触发一次。"}
T[13234]={"^Permanently enchant a melee weapon for your spell, ranged and melee attacks to increase your Attack Power by (.-) and your Spell Power by (.-) for (.-)%.  This can not occur more than once every 22%.5 seconds%.%s*$","永久性地为一把近战武器附魔，使你的攻击强度提高 {{1}}、法术强度提高 {{2}}，持续 {{3}}。此效果每 22.5 秒最多触发一次。"}
