T[13236]={"^Permanently enchant a melee weapon for your spell, ranged and melee attacks have a chance to increase your Armor Penetration rating by (.-) for (.-)%. This can not occur more than once every 20 seconds%.%s*$","永久：为一把近战武器附魔，使你的法术、远程与近战攻击有几率在 {{2}} 内使你的护甲穿透等级提高 {{1}}。此效果每 20 秒最多触发一次。"}
