T[13399]={"^Grants Arcing Strike a chance to cause an Injury to the target, reducing their |cffff8100Movement Speed|r by (.-)%% for (.-)%.\n\nTendon Slash against enemies with an Injury consumes the effect to deal (.-)%% increased damage%.%s*$","Otorga a Golpe de arco una probabilidad de infligir una Herida al objetivo, reduciendo su |cffff8100Velocidad de movimiento|r un {{1}}% durante {{2}}.\n\nTajada de tendón contra enemigos con una Herida consume el efecto para infligir un {{3}}% de daño aumentado."}
