T[13574]={"^Deals (.-) damage every (.-) sec%.\n\nDamage against Undead increased by 100%%%.\n\nYour eyes tingle as you begin to understand the world from a different perspective%.%.%.%s*$","Inflige {{1}} de daño cada {{2}} seg.\n\nEl daño contra los No Muertos aumenta un 100%.\n\nTus ojos hormiguean al empezar a comprender el mundo desde una perspectiva diferente..."}
