T[13871]={"^All damage dealt is increased by (.-)%%%.\nAttack speed increased by (.-)%%%.\nImmune to Taunt%.%s*$","Todo el daño infligido aumenta un {{1}}%.\nLa velocidad de ataque aumenta un {{2}}%.\nInmune a provocar."}
