T[14154]={"^|cffffffffGaze of C'thun|r now reduces the casting speed of your next 2 |cffffffffHorrorbolts|r or |cffffffffEldritch Mendings|r by (.-)%% for (.-)%.%s*$","La |cffffffffGaze of C'thun|r ahora reduce la velocidad de lanzamiento de tus próximos 2 |cffffffffRayo de horror|r o |cffffffffRemiendo sobrenatural|r en un {{1}}% durante {{2}}."}
