T[15266]={"^Melee attack speed increased by (.-)%% and and reduces magic damage taken by 8%%%. Your successful parries immediately attack the target and reduce the duration of Blurred Blade%.%s*$","La velocidad de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo aumenta un {{1}}% y reduce el daño de magia recibido un 8%. Tus paradas exitosas atacan inmediatamente al objetivo y reducen la duración de Hoja borrosa."}
