T[15302]={"^Game Over\n\nAll damage dealt increased by 500%%%.\nAttack speed increased by 100%%%.\nMovement speed increased by 100%%%.\nImmune to taunt and attack me effects%.%s*$","Fin de la partida\n\nTodo el daño infligido aumenta un 500%.\nLa velocidad de ataque aumenta un 100%.\nLa velocidad de movimiento aumenta un 100%.\nInmune a los efectos de provocar y de ataque."}
