T[21026]={"^The damage of your next Arcane Explosion is increased by (.-)%% and its mana cost reduced by (.-)%%%.%s*$","El daño de tu próxima Explosión arcana aumenta un {{1}}% y su coste de maná se reduce un {{1}}%."}
