T[26000]={"^Increased melee and ranged attack power%.%s*$","近战和远程攻击强度提高。"}
T[26001]={"^Cannot be protected by Divine Shield, Divine Protection or Hand of Protection%.%s*$","无法受到圣盾术、保护之手或牺牲之手保护。"}
T[26002]={"^Damage taken reduced by up to (.-)%%, strength and stamina increased by (.-)%%, and blocked, parried, and dodged melee attacks cause a gain (.-)%% of maximum displayed mana%.%s*$","受到的伤害最多降低{{1}}%，力量和耐力提高{{2}}%，被格挡、招架和躲闪的近战攻击会使你获得{{3}}%的最大法力值。"}
T[26003]={"^Reduces Arcane, Fire, Frost, Nature, and Shadow resistances by (.-)%.  Increases magic damage taken by (.-)%%%.%s*$","奥术、火焰、冰霜、自然和暗影抗性降低{{1}}点。受到的魔法伤害提高{{2}}%。"}
