T[26005]={"^Generates (.-) rage and heals (.-)%% of your total health every (.-) sec%.%s*$","每秒产生{{1}}点怒气，每{{3}}秒恢复你总生命值的{{2}}%。"}
T[26006]={"^Shielded against damage: losing mana instead of health%.%s*$","受到伤害护盾保护：失去法力值而非生命值。"}
T[26007]={"^Reduces melee damage taken by (.-)%%%.%s*$","受到近战攻击的伤害降低{{1}}%。"}
